<div
  class="career-map"
  role="img"
  aria-labelledby="career-map-title career-map-desc"
>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 760 440" aria-hidden="true">
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id="route" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1">
        <stop offset="0" stop-color="#4d7cff" />
        <stop offset="1" stop-color="#35d0ba" />
      </linearGradient>
    </defs>
    <path class="career-route" d="M380 72 C250 110 180 150 160 205 C140 265 230 292 330 300 C450 310 530 336 590 382" />
    <path class="career-branch" d="M380 72 C470 115 530 145 580 200" />
    <path class="career-branch" d="M160 205 C245 185 300 175 375 185" />
    <path class="career-branch" d="M375 185 C455 205 520 212 580 200" />
    <path class="career-branch" d="M330 300 C435 274 510 242 580 200" />

    <g class="career-node primary" transform="translate(300 34)">
      <rect width="160" height="72" rx="18" />
      <text x="80" y="34">AI / ML</text>
      <text class="node-sub" x="80" y="55" data-i18n data-en="modeling · statistics" data-ko="모델링 · 통계">modeling · statistics</text>
    </g>
    <g class="career-node" transform="translate(80 170)">
      <rect width="160" height="72" rx="18" />
      <text x="80" y="34" data-i18n data-en="Medical AI" data-ko="의료 AI">Medical AI</text>
      <text class="node-sub" x="80" y="55" data-i18n data-en="MRI · hippocampus" data-ko="MRI · 해마">MRI · hippocampus</text>
    </g>
    <g class="career-node" transform="translate(295 150)">
      <rect width="160" height="72" rx="18" />
      <text x="80" y="34" data-i18n data-en="Computer Vision" data-ko="컴퓨터 비전">Computer Vision</text>
      <text class="node-sub" x="80" y="55" data-i18n data-en="segmentation · 3D" data-ko="분할 · 3D">segmentation · 3D</text>
    </g>
    <g class="career-node" transform="translate(500 165)">
      <rect width="160" height="72" rx="18" />
      <text x="80" y="34" data-i18n data-en="Data Science" data-ko="데이터 사이언스">Data Science</text>
      <text class="node-sub" x="80" y="55" data-i18n data-en="KNN · experiments" data-ko="KNN · 실험">KNN · experiments</text>
    </g>
    <g class="career-node" transform="translate(250 275)">
      <rect width="160" height="72" rx="18" />
      <text x="80" y="34" data-i18n data-en="3D & Sensors" data-ko="3D · 센서">3D & Sensors</text>
      <text class="node-sub" x="80" y="55" data-i18n data-en="point cloud · LiDAR" data-ko="Point Cloud · LiDAR">point cloud · LiDAR</text>
    </g>
    <g class="career-node" transform="translate(510 350)">
      <rect width="160" height="72" rx="18" />
      <text x="80" y="34" data-i18n data-en="Manufacturing AI" data-ko="제조 AI">Manufacturing AI</text>
      <text class="node-sub" x="80" y="55" data-i18n data-en="automation · process" data-ko="자동화 · 공정">automation · process</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <div class="career-map-copy">
    <p
      id="career-map-title"
      class="eyebrow"
      data-i18n
      data-en="Career map"
      data-ko="커리어 맵"
    >Career map</p>
    <h3
      data-i18n
      data-en="One problem-solving spine, several domains."
      data-ko="하나의 문제 해결 방식, 여러 산업 분야."
    >One problem-solving spine, several domains.</h3>
    <p
      id="career-map-desc"
      data-i18n
      data-en="My work expands from medical geometry to vision, 3D sensors, automation, and manufacturing data. The domain changes; the method stays consistent: define the measurable failure, restructure the pipeline, and validate the trade-off."
      data-ko="의료 형상 분석에서 비전, 3D 센서, 자동화, 제조 데이터까지 연구 영역을 넓혀 왔습니다. 분야는 달라도 문제를 측정 가능하게 정의하고, 처리 구조를 다시 설계한 뒤 trade-off를 검증하는 방식은 일관됩니다."
    >
      My work expands from medical geometry to vision, 3D sensors, automation, and manufacturing data. The domain changes; the method stays consistent: define the measurable failure, restructure the pipeline, and validate the trade-off.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

